      Optional. The OAuth *web* client ID that Sign in with Google mints tokens
      for — the value the API checks the token's `aud` against.

      Left out on purpose: with google-services.json in place, the Gradle plugin
      generates `default_web_client_id` from it and GoogleAuthPlugin falls back
      to that, so an app already configured for FCM needs nothing here. Add this
      only to point the APK at a different client from the Firebase project's:

